      <h2>4. Managing Cookies</h2>
      <p>Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can set your browser to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Block all cookies</li>
        <li>Accept all cookies</li>
        <li>Alert you when a cookie is being set</li>
        <li>Delete cookies when you close your browser</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Please note that blocking or deleting cookies may affect your experience on our website and some features may not work as intended.</p>
      <p>For more information about managing cookies in your browser, visit:</p>
